#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions calculate the complex arc hyperbolic sine of I<z>.  If I<y\\ "
"=\\ casinh(z)>, then I<z\\ =\\ csinh(y)>.  The imaginary part of I<y> is "
"chosen in the interval [-pi/2,pi/2]."
msgstr ""
"Diese Funktionen berechnen den komplexen hyperbolischen Arkussinus von I<z>. "
"Falls I<y\\ =\\ casinh(z)>, dann I<z\\ =\\ csinh(y)>. Der Imaginärteil von "
"I<y> wird im Intervall [-pi/2,pi/2] gewählt."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "One has:"
msgstr "Es gilt:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "casinh(z) = clog(z + csqrt(z * z + 1))\n"
msgstr "casinh(z) = clog(z + csqrt(z * z + 1))\n"

